description:
Reads a PDF from its public https address and returns its text, page by page (parse / read a PDF: invoices, papers, reports, contracts, forms…). Up to 10 MB; use start to read further.
Use when: you need the text content of a PDF file. Not for scanned PDFs (images only): those need OCR.
Example: {"url":"https://pdf.faceabot.com/sample.pdf"}
